                "id": "wpforo_topic_1",
                "title": "WPForo论坛如何自定义样式？",
                "slug": "wpforo-custom-style",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>想修改WPForo论坛的默认样式，让它更符合网站整体风格。请问应该如何操作？</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>具体需求：</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul>\n<li>修改主题色为品牌色 #1976D2</li>\n<li>调整帖子列表的行距和字体大小</li>\n<li>自定义用户头像显示样式</li>\n<li>修改按钮样式</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可以通过CSS覆盖还是需要修改模板文件？有没有推荐的方法？</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "forum": "wpforo_forum_1",
                "author": "design_lover",
                "views": 156,
                "likes": 8,
                "meta": {
                    "is_sticky": false,
                    "is_closed": false,
                    "is_private": false
                },
                "verification": {
                    "title_contains": "自定义样式",
                    "content_contains": "CSS覆盖"
                }
            },
            {
                "id": "wpforo_topic_2",
                "title": "WPForo如何实现用户等级系统？",
                "slug": "wpforo-user-levels",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>想给论坛添加用户等级系统，根据发帖数量和积分显示不同的头衔和徽章。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>例如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul>\n<li>新手会员：0-10帖</li>\n<li>活跃会员：10-50帖</li>\n<li>资深会员：50-200帖</li>\n<li>版主大大：200帖以上</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WPForo是否自带这个功能？还是需要额外插件？</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "forum": "wpforo_forum_1",
                "author": "forum_admin",
                "views": 89,
                "likes": 5,
                "meta": {
                    "is_sticky": true,
                    "is_closed": false,
                    "is_private": false
                },
                "verification": {
                    "title_contains": "用户等级",
                    "content_contains": "发帖数量"
                }
            },
            {
                "id": "wpforo_topic_3",
                "title": "WPForo邮件通知不发送的问题",
                "slug": "wpforo-email-issue",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>用户订阅帖子后收不到邮件通知，已经检查过：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress邮件设置正常，可以发送测试邮件</li>\n<li>WPForo邮件设置已开启</li>\n<li>用户已勾选订阅选项</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>但就是收不到通知邮件，请问还有什么地方需要检查？</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "forum": "wpforo_forum_2",
                "author": "email_trouble",
                "views": 67,
                "likes": 2,
                "meta": {
                    "is_sticky": false,
                    "is_closed": false,
                    "is_private": false
                },
                "verification": {
                    "title_contains": "邮件通知",
                    "content_contains": "收不到"
                }
            }
        ],
        "replies": [
            {
                "id": "wpforo_reply_1_1",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WPForo支持多种自定义方式：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>方法一：使用内置样式设置</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>后台 > WPForo > Settings > Styles 可以修改颜色、字体等基础样式。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>方法二：自定义CSS</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在主题的style.css或Customizer的Additional CSS中添加覆盖样式：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>#wpforo-wrap {\n  --wpf-color-primary: #1976D2;\n}\n.wpforo-post .wpf-post-content {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "topic": "wpforo_topic_1",
                "author": "wpforo_helper",
                "likes": 12,
                "verification": {
                    "content_contains": "自定义CSS"
                }
            },
            {
                "id": "wpforo_reply_1_2",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果需要更深度的自定义，可以创建模板覆盖：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol>\n<li>复制 wp-content/plugins/wpforo/wpf-themes/ 到主题目录</li>\n<li>修改对应的PHP模板文件</li>\n<li>WPForo会自动加载主题目录下的模板</li>\n</ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>不过建议先用CSS解决，模板覆盖维护成本较高。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "topic": "wpforo_topic_1",
                "author": "theme_dev",
                "likes": 6,
                "verification": {
                    "content_contains": "模板覆盖"
                }
            },
            {
                "id": "wpforo_reply_2_1",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WPForo自带用户等级功能！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>设置路径：WPForo > Members > Reputation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可以设置：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul>\n<li>等级名称和图标</li>\n<li>升级所需积分</li>\n<li>发帖、回帖获得的积分</li>\n<li>被点赞获得的积分</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>不需要额外插件，免费版就有这个功能。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "topic": "wpforo_topic_2",
                "author": "wpforo_fan",
                "likes": 15,
                "verification": {
                    "content_contains": "Reputation"
                }
            },
            {
                "id": "wpforo_reply_3_1",
                "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>邮件问题通常出在以下几个地方：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol>\n<li><strong>SMTP配置</strong> - 建议使用WP Mail SMTP插件配置专业邮件服务</li>\n<li><strong>邮件队列</strong> - WPForo > Tools > Emails 检查队列状态</li>\n<li><strong>Cron任务</strong> - 确保wp-cron正常运行</li>\n<li><strong>垃圾邮件</strong> - 让用户检查垃圾邮件文件夹</li>\n</ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>建议先安装WP Mail SMTP，配置SendGrid或Mailgun，测试邮件发送。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
                "status": "publish",
                "topic": "wpforo_topic_3",
                "author": "email_expert",
                "likes": 4,
                "verification": {
                    "content_contains": "WP Mail SMTP"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
